### Update an existing lab test by ID
PUT http://localhost:8030/lab-test/update/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Complete Blood Count - Updated",
  "date": "2025-02-01T09:30:00Z",
  "tests": [
    {
      "testName": "Hemoglobin",
      "result": 14.1,
      "unit": "g/dL",
      "status": "NORMAL"
    },
    {
      "testName": "WBC",
      "result": 10.2,
      "unit": "10^9/L",
      "status": "HIGH"
    }
  ],
  "testId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"
}

###
